                       "description":  "Before any GUI automation can run, users must load a configuration file that defines the visual automation environment: image targets, states, transitions, workflows, and monitors. The header area shows the current configuration status with an animated indicator when a config is loaded. Users can load a new configuration from a file picker or reload the last-used configuration. The configuration status indicator provides visual feedback (animated ping, active badge) so users immediately know whether a valid config is loaded and which one it is.",
