                       "description":  "The main panel (left 2/3) is the workflow runner where users select and start GUI automation workflows. It includes a searchable workflow dropdown populated from the loaded config, monitor selection controls for choosing which state monitors to activate, an auto-minimize toggle for the runner window during execution, state initialization overrides for testing specific starting states, and a large start/stop button for execution control. The panel is disabled when no configuration is loaded, and users must select at least one workflow and monitor combination before starting.",
                       "provenance":  {
                                          "source":  "migrated"
                                      }
