                       "description":  "The right sidebar (1/3 width) provides the automation toolkit with quick actions and saved macros. Quick actions are one-click convenience operations for common automation tasks. Macros are saved sequences of automation steps that can be executed independently of full workflows -- useful for repetitive setup tasks, quick verifications, or testing specific interaction sequences. Users can run macros directly from the sidebar, with loading states and result feedback shown inline. The sidebar also includes a refresh control for reloading the macro list from the runner backend.",
