                       "description":  "The GUI Automation page uses a responsive two-column grid layout: the workflow runner occupies 2/3 of the width and the automation toolkit sidebar takes the remaining 1/3. A header bar at the top shows the configuration status and load controls. The page is a dev-only feature hidden in production, accessible through the runner\u0027s navigation system. A tutorial menu provides contextual help for new users. The page scrolls vertically when content exceeds viewport height, with the header remaining visible.",
